<title>MEXICO: Bancomer postpones earnings report.</title>
<headline>Bancomer postpones earnings report.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Fiananciero Bancomer has been granted an extension of its reporting deadline for third-quarter earnings, the Mexican stock exchange said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The financial group said its board of directors would be out of town on Monday, Bancomer's original reporting deadline.</p>
<p>Bancomer will report on November 1, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>--Maria Luisa Aguilar, Mexico City newsroom, (525) 728-9553</p>
